<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez sets SHK Prop call warrants.</title>
<headline>Indosuez sets SHK Prop call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Tuesday it has issued 30 million American-style call warrants on shares of Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$87.30     PREMIUM	 10.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.9982    GEARING	 4.85x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  10.DEC.97    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
